        },
        "quote": "(a) In addition to the suspension or revocation of a license available to the City under TMC 12.45.120 , it shall be unlawful for any person or contractor licensed by the City, its employee, agent or subcontractor to cause, permit or allow the following:",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:12.45.110:block:0#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 12.45.110 block 1",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 1,
          "component_id": "275f0116-5ef3-56d1-a63f-66a090cdf3ba",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 292,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:12.45.110:block:1",
          "start": 255
        },
        "quote": "(1) Fail to obtain the proper permit;",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:12.45.110:block:1#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 12.45.110 block 2",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 2,
          "component_id": "ef4edf75-c191-5885-9f5f-e9498fe222ef",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 358,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:12.45.110:block:2",
          "start": 293
        },
        "quote": "(2) Fail to complete all work within the specified permit limits;",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:12.45.110:block:2#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 12.45.110 block 3",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 3,
          "component_id": "bcf3ce99-fdaf-54fc-b131-a533c00aa824",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 502,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:12.45.110:block:3",
          "start": 359
        },
        "quote": "(3) Fail to restore the right-of-way or easement to the same condition that existed prior to commencement of the work authorized by the permit;",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:12.45.110:block:3#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 12.45.110 block 4",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 4,
          "component_id": "4dd28c83-f757-5e3a-92f8-e0d0bd4c0455",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 713,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:12.45.110:block:4",
          "start": 503
        },
        "quote": "(4) Fail to establish traffic control in accordance with the Manual of Uniform Traffic Control, current City-approved edition, or such other rules, regulations, or restrictions promulgated by the City Engineer;",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:12.45.110:block:4#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 12.45.110 block 5",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 5,
          "component_id": "249b02f4-7ca7-5c2d-bc1c-a5ee39bf6bc7",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 852,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:12.45.110:block:5",
          "start": 714
        },
        "quote": "(5) Fail to notify the City of Topeka, Engineering Division construction management, of the commencement of work authorized by the permit;",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:12.45.110:block:5#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 12.45.110 block 6",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 6,
          "component_id": "8b1015db-161f-5578-80e1-8f3c995d7301",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 986,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:12.45.110:block:6",
          "start": 853
        },
        "quote": "(6) Fail to execute work in accordance with the City of Topeka Standard Technical Specifications and Detail Drawings, latest edition;",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:12.45.110:block:6#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 12.45.110 block 7",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 7,
          "component_id": "31ce4e0f-99aa-5978-ad3c-cb4ef32e6be0",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 1066,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:12.45.110:block:7",
          "start": 987
        },
        "quote": "(7) To remove or interfere with any traffic control device in the right-of-way;",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:12.45.110:block:7#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 12.45.110 block 8",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 8,
          "component_id": "2c0b192e-9ee6-51c1-9c93-458a243166d1",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 1176,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:12.45.110:block:8",
          "start": 1067
        },
        "quote": "(8) To cut, damage or break any curb, gutter or sidewalk unless authorized under a permit issued by the City;",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:12.45.110:block:8#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 12.45.110 block 9",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 9,
          "component_id": "9485c65d-a4c9-530b-89ad-6211f5121719",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 1238,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:12.45.110:block:9",
          "start": 1177
        },
        "quote": "(9) To interfere with traffic in violation of TMC 12.45.080 ;",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:12.45.110:block:9#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 12.45.110 block 10",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 10,
          "component_id": "3e325d02-c8f4-5de0-8f96-9973a104cf86",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 1412,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:12.45.110:block:10",
          "start": 1239
        },
        "quote": "(10) To hinder or obstruct the repair or construction of any public improvement or other work in the City’s right-of-way pursuant to any permit issued under this article; or",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:12.45.110:block:10#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 12.45.110 block 11",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 11,
          "component_id": "e3d44fe8-cf4c-5324-8c31-1af80b00306a",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 1472,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:12.45.110:block:11",
          "start": 1413
        },
        "quote": "(11) Fail to remove an existing obsolete driveway approach.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:12.45.110:block:11#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 12.45.110 block 12",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 12,
          "component_id": "9b490d29-6579-5cb2-bb66-eb7bec1aadd1",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 1530,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:12.45.110:block:12",
          "start": 1473
        },
        "quote": "(b) Any person violating this section may be punished by:",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:12.45.110:block:12#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 12.45.110 block 13",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 13,
          "component_id": "758aaaba-409c-5ba9-bfd7-e5ddc3fe3e39",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 1567,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:12.45.110:block:13",
          "start": 1531
        },
        "quote": "(1) A fine of not more than $499.00;",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:12.45.110:block:13#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 12.45.110 block 14",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 14,
          "component_id": "b183d112-5965-5345-9e99-112c0978023b",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 1623,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:12.45.110:block:14",
          "start": 1568
        },
        "quote": "(2) Imprisonment in jail for not more than 179 days; or",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:12.45.110:block:14#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 12.45.110 block 15",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 15,
          "component_id": "0d38f630-394b-5d9a-ac89-dda5440eec0a",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 1742,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:12.45.110:block:15",
          "start": 1624
        },
        "quote": "(3) Both such fine and imprisonment not to exceed the limits set out in subsections (b)(1) and (b)(2) of this section.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:12.45.110:block:15#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 12.45.110 block 16",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 16,
          "component_id": "7e292560-bd08-5432-896f-95237e56768e",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 1972,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:12.45.110:block:16",
          "start": 1743
        },
        "quote": "(c) Provided, however, contractors holding a valid license with the City shall be given notice of a violation with opportunity to cure in accordance with the provisions of TMC 12.45.120(b) prior to prosecution under this section.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:12.45.110:block:16#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 12.45.110 block 17",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 17,
          "component_id": "fcb5d2a5-0085-5de7-b73b-0da593b0773b",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 2251,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:12.45.110:block:17",
          "start": 1973
        },
        "quote": "(d) Provided, however, entities holding a valid franchise agreement with the City shall be given notice of a violation and an opportunity to cure in accordance with the franchise agreement prior to prosecution under this section. (Ord. 19370 § 89, 3-23-10. Code 1995 § 130-163.)",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:12.45.110:block:17#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 12.45.110 block 18",
